    "encrypted": "false",
    "display_name": "Write Your README",
    "long_instructions": "# Write Your README\r\n\r\n**Goal:** Document your app so someone else can understand and use it without you explaining it.\r\n\r\nYour README should include:\r\n\r\n### 1. App Description\r\n\r\n* What is the name of your app?\r\n* What does it do?\r\n* Who is it for?\r\n* What problem or purpose does it serve?\r\n\r\n### 2. How to Use It\r\n\r\n* What does the user see first?\r\n* How does the user interact with the app?\r\n* What happens when they click or search?\r\n\r\n\r\n### 3. Data Attribution\r\n\r\n* What API did you use?\r\n* Include a working link to the API source.\r\n* Briefly explain what kind of data it provides.\r\n\r\n",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Create a clear README that explains your app’s purpose, how to use it, and which API it depends on. ***(supports completing Milestone 4 tasks)***",
